The **Settings** window is displayed. *- green ring*

VS Code distinguishes between **User Settings (global)** and **Workspace Settings (project-specific)**. You can toggle between them using the buttons at the top-right of the **Settings** panel:
 - For **User** Settings click the **User** button. *- red ring*
 - For **Workspace** Settings click the **Workspace** button. *- orange ring*

